D}(\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}-\\frac{∂P}{∂y})\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nGreen's theorem can be extended to include regions containing holes. In such cases, we can apply Green's theorem in the same way as before.\n\nWe have that $P(x,y)=8y$ and $Q(x,y)=-6x.$ So,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂y}=8,\\,\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}=-6.\n$$\n\nTherefore, applying Green's theorem, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∮}_{∂D}8y\\,dx-6x\\,dy & ={∬}_{D}(\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}-\\frac{∂P}{∂y})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(-6-8)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}-14\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =-14{∬}_{D}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =-14\\cdot \\text{Area}(D) \\\\  & =-14\\cdot (16\\cdot 10-{4}^{2}-{2}^{2}) \\\\  & =-14\\cdot (160-16-4) \\\\  & =-14\\cdot 140 \\\\  & =-1960.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535896 17592186045443 true] [17592186538172 1080 "\\frac{57\\pi}{2}" 13194139535896 17592186045443 true] [17592186538172 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535896 17592186045443 true] [17592186538172 1083 #uuid "617c9ac0-970c-54d5-982f-e31ce5878129" 13194139535896 17592186045443 true] [17592186538173 1080 "510\\pi" 13194139535896 17592186045443 true] [17592186538173 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535896 17592186045443 true] [17592186538173 1083 #uuid "66452399-e90b-503f-8285-f8443359f389" 13194139535896 17592186045443 true] [17592186538174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186538160 13194139535896 17592186045443 true] [17592186538174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186538173 13194139535896 17592186045443 true] [17592186538174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186538177 13194139535896 17592186045443 true] [17592186538174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186538188 13194139535896 17592186045443 true] [17592186538174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186538210 13194139535896 17592186045443 true] [17592186538174 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139535896 17592186045443 true] [17592186538174 1077 "selection" 13194139535896 17592186045443 true] [17592186538174 1078 #edb/ref 17592186538177 13194139535896 17592186045443 true] [17592186538174 1079 #uuid "6b9efb0e-1e55-59e1-a247-642db1fe26b6" 13194139535896 17592186045443 true